@startuml symbol-relations
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title 符号2-7：六种关系（箭头方向 = 给分点）

' ② 继承 Generalization
class Animal
class Dog
Animal <|-- Dog : ② 继承\n实线+空心三角→指向父类

' ③ 实现 Realization
interface Payable
class Alipay
Payable <|.. Alipay : ③ 实现\n虚线+空心三角→指向接口

' ④ 关联 Association
class Customer
class Order
Customer "1" --> "0..*" Order : ④ 关联\n实线箭头→长期持有(成员变量)

' ⑤ 依赖 Dependency
class ReportService
class PDFExporter
ReportService ..> PDFExporter : ⑤ 依赖\n虚线箭头→临时使用(参数/局部变量)

' ⑥ 组合 Composition
class House
class Room
House *-- Room : ⑥ 组合\n实心菱形在整体端→同生共死

' ⑦ 聚合 Aggregation
class Team
class Member
Team o-- Member : ⑦ 聚合\n空心菱形在整体端→可独立存在
@enduml
